" ⠿ overbrainer   1 Dataset  2 Pipeline  3 Training  4 Logs          rust_expert "
"╭ data ────────────────────────────╮╭ question ────────────────────────────────╮"
"│ ▼ ownership  2 sub, 5 q, 4 a     ││ What happens to a borrow when the owner  │"
"│   ▼ Borrowing  3 q, 2 a          ││ is moved?                                │"
"│       [a] What happens to a borr ││                                          │"
"│       [x] Why can't a &mut and a ││ id 0a40…e3d3  answered, usable           │"
"│       [ ] When does NLL end a bo ││                                          │"
"│   ▶ Lifetimes  1 q, 1 a          ││ model deepseek-r1  in 312  out 1840      │"
"│   ▶ (missing subtopic)  1 q, 1 a ││ finish stop  reasoning raw               │"
"│   traits  0 sub, 0 q, 0 a        ││ ── reasoning ──                          │"
"│ ▶ old_topic (not configured)     ││ Let me think about what a move does to a │"
"│                                  ││ borrow.                                  │"
"│                                  ││ The borrow checker tracks every live     │"
"│                                  ││ reference to the owner.                  │"
"│                                  ││ A move invalidates the owner's place, so │"
"│                                  ││ no borrow may outlive it.                │"
"│                                  ││ ── answer ──                             │"
"│                                  ││ The borrow must end before the move.     │"
"│                                  ││ If a reference is still used after the   │"
"│                                  ││ move, the compiler reports E0505: cannot │"
"│                                  ││ move out of the value because it is      │"
"│                                  ││ borrowed.                                │"
